intro.title=Introduction
intro.description=Take your first steps, and gather what a first camp is built from.

skip-intro.title=Skip Intro
skip-intro.description=Use /ojournal or /oquest abandon Intro to skip the tutorial.

craft-tools.title=Craft a hatchet and pickaxe
craft-tools.description=Two tools, and the world opens up.

craft-workbench.title=Craft a workbench
craft-workbench.description=Break what you need, carry it home, and build the bench.

choose-weapon.title=Choose your weapon
choose-weapon.description=One of the four. The others can wait.

gather-stick.title=Gather sticks
gather-stick.description=Pick up sticks from the ground and from bushes.

gather-fibre.title=Gather fibre
gather-fibre.description=Pull fibre from the tall grass around you.

gather-rubble.title=Gather stone rubble
gather-rubble.description=Break rocks to collect stone rubble.

craft-hatchet.title=Craft a crude hatchet
craft-hatchet.description=Sticks and stone make an edge good enough for wood.

craft-pickaxe.title=Craft a crude pickaxe
craft-pickaxe.description=The same again, shaped for rock.

break-wood.title=Break some wood
break-wood.description=Use your hatchet to cut trunks.

break-stone.title=Break some stone
break-stone.description=Use your pickaxe to break rocks.

gather-wood.title=Gather wood
gather-wood.description=Four pieces, carried rather than left where they fell.

gather-stone.title=Gather stone
gather-stone.description=Three pieces will do for the bench.

craft-bench.title=Craft the workbench
craft-bench.description=Put the wood and the stone together.

place-bench.title=Put the workbench down
place-bench.description=A bench in your pack is no use to anyone.

craft-sword.title=Craft a crude sword
craft-sword.description=The straightforward answer.

craft-daggers.title=Craft crude daggers
craft-daggers.description=Two blades for whoever would rather be quick.

craft-mace.title=Craft a crude mace
craft-mace.description=Nothing subtle about it.

craft-battleaxe.title=Craft a crude battleaxe
craft-battleaxe.description=Slow, and worth the wait.

defeat-guardian.title=Defeat the Guardian
defeat-guardian.description=Bring down the crystal golem watching over the temple.

enter-forgotten-temple.title=Enter the Forgotten Temple
enter-forgotten-temple.description=Find your way inside the temple the guardian was protecting.

talk-merchant.title=Talk to the temple merchant
talk-merchant.description=Speak with the Kweebec merchant who trades inside the Forgotten Temple.
talk-merchant.in-temple=Inside the Forgotten Temple

gather-meat.title=Gather meat
gather-meat.description=Whatever you bring down, carry a cut of it home.

craft-campfire.title=Craft a campfire
craft-campfire.description=Four sticks and some rubble. Raw meat makes no dinner.

cook-meat.title=Cook your meat
cook-meat.description=Lay the meat in the fire, feed it fuel, and take back what comes out.

eat-meat.title=Eat your meat
eat-meat.description=The fire did its part. Now eat.

run-novice.title=Find your stride
run-novice.description=Cover a hundred metres on your own two feet.
run-adept.title=Long hauler
run-adept.description=A thousand metres. The world is wider than the camp.
run-master.title=Tireless
run-master.description=Ten thousand metres, and still going.

sprint-novice.title=Turn of speed
sprint-novice.description=Fifty metres at a sprint, while the breath lasts.
sprint-adept.title=Fleet footed
sprint-adept.description=Five hundred metres at a sprint, gathered a burst at a time.
sprint-master.title=Wind runner
sprint-master.description=Five thousand metres at a sprint. Nothing catches you now.

jump-novice.title=Off the ground
jump-novice.description=Twenty-five jumps, for no reason at all.
jump-adept.title=Sure footed
jump-adept.description=Two hundred and fifty jumps. Ledges stopped mattering a while back.
jump-master.title=Skyward
jump-master.description=Two thousand five hundred jumps. Gravity is a suggestion.

temple-trial.title=The Temple's trial
temple-trial.description=Three minutes to prove yourself inside the Forgotten Temple.
temple-trial.in-temple=Stay inside the Forgotten Temple: leaving fails the trial
temple-warmup.title=Sprint-jump at the rune altar
temple-warmup.description=Jump ten times while sprinting, close to the rune altar under the temple's central gate.
temple-warmup.sprinting=While sprinting
temple-warmup.near-altar=Within 12 blocks of the rune altar
temple-offering.title=Offer essence at the rune altar
temple-offering.description=Throw ten Essence of Life at the foot of the rune altar.
temple-offering.in-temple=Inside the Forgotten Temple
temple-offering.near-altar=Within 6 blocks of the rune altar
temple-race.title=Run to the rune altar
temple-race.description=Reach the rune altar under the temple's central gate.
temple-run.title=Run through the temple for 20 seconds
temple-run.description=Run for 20 seconds, exploring the temple grounds.
temple-hold.title=Explore the temple for a minute
temple-hold.description=Spend at least one minute inside the temple, looking around.

daily-chores.title=Garden chores
daily-chores.description=Pick berries, gather flowers and put the harvest away in a chest.
chores-berries.title=Pick wild berries
chores-berries.description=Pick wild berries from the bushes.
chores-flowers.title=Gather flowers
chores-flowers.description=Pick five flowers to brighten up the house.
chores-chest.title=Open a wooden chest
chores-chest.description=Open a wooden chest to put the harvest away.

great-felling.title=The Great Felling
great-felling.description=Fell 500 tree trunks, all of you together.

first-blood.title=First blood
first-blood.description=Another player fell by your hand.

flawless.title=Flawless
flawless.description=You passed the Temple's trial without ever failing it.
flawless-passed.title=Pass the Temple's trial
flawless-never-failed.title=Never fail it

silent-step.title=Silent step
silent-step.description=Walk five hundred metres without making a sound.
lumberjack.title=Lumberjack
lumberjack.description=Fell trees and bring back twenty trunks.

goblin-breach-intruders.title=Through the breach
goblin-breach-intruders.description=Goblins swarm the ruins of this lost settlement. Clear a way in.
goblin-breach-scrap.title=Scrap collector
goblin-breach-scrap.description=Goblins build everything from scrap. Hoard a good pile of it.
goblin-breach-miners.title=Down the mine
goblin-breach-miners.description=Miners dig ore out of the caves under the ruins. Put an end to their digging.
goblin-breach-turrets.title=Silence the turrets
goblin-breach-turrets.description=Goblin turrets keep watch from the towers. Take them down one by one.
goblin-breach-lobbers.title=Bomb throwers
goblin-breach-lobbers.description=Lobbers rain bombs on anyone who comes near. Get close and stop them.
goblin-breach-boom-powder.title=Boom powder
goblin-breach-boom-powder.description=The bomb throwers carry the powder that makes their toys go off. Take it for yourself.
goblin-breach-bangstick.title=Bangsticks
goblin-breach-bangstick.description=Turn the powder against its owners: assemble two bangsticks at the goblin workbench.
goblin-breach-skeletons.title=The restless dead
goblin-breach-skeletons.description=The old settlers still walk their ruins. Lay them to rest.
goblin-breach-revenant.title=The Revenant Guardian
goblin-breach-revenant.description=Deep in the crypt, an armoured knight still guards its masters. Defeat it.
goblin-breach-glutton.title=The Glutton
goblin-breach-glutton.description=A goblin of enormous appetite rules the arenas of the slums. Challenge it.
goblin-breach-spiders.title=Webbed tunnels
goblin-breach-spiders.description=Cave spiders have taken over whole tunnels. Clear their nests.
goblin-breach-silk.title=Spider silk
goblin-breach-silk.description=Goblin gadgets need strong thread. Gather silk from the spiders.
goblin-breach-scrap-hook.title=A sturdy hook
goblin-breach-scrap-hook.description=Forge a scrap hook at the goblin workbench.
goblin-breach-hookshot.title=Hookshot
goblin-breach-hookshot.description=Hook, silk and a gadget: build a hookshot to reach the high places.
goblin-breach-anomalies.title=Void anomalies
goblin-breach-anomalies.description=Void crystals tear through the land. Shatter three anomalies.
goblin-breach-void-crystals.title=Void crystals
goblin-breach-void-crystals.description=Shattered anomalies leave crystals still humming with the Void. Collect them.
goblin-breach-gadgets.title=Gadget assemblies
goblin-breach-gadgets.description=Scrap and void crystal make the heart of every goblin gadget. Assemble three.
goblin-breach-voidtaken.title=The Voidtaken Grizzly
goblin-breach-voidtaken.description=A grizzly twisted by the Void prowls the breach. Hunt it down.
goblin-breach-void-spawn.title=Creatures of the Void
goblin-breach-void-spawn.description=Larvae, crawlers and worse pour out of the anomalies. Drive them back.
goblin-breach-coffer-key.title=A veilbound key
goblin-breach-coffer-key.description=Some Void creatures carry a strange key. Take one from them.
goblin-breach-coffer.title=The veilbound coffer
goblin-breach-coffer.description=Open a locked coffer and hold off the goblins who come running for its treasure.
goblin-breach-fragment.title=A fragment of your own
goblin-breach-fragment.description=Forge a fragment of the Guttering Hollows to open the breach whenever you like.
goblin-breach-rocket-boots.title=Rocket boots
goblin-breach-rocket-boots.description=Bangsticks, gadgets and voidtaken hide: build boots that leap like an explosion.
goblin-breach-glider.title=Scrap glider
goblin-breach-glider.description=The goblins' finest work: a glider of scrap and silk to soar off the towers.
goblin-breach-survivor-goblins.title=Thirty goblins, no fall
goblin-breach-survivor.title=Master of the breach
goblin-breach-survivor.description=Cut down thirty goblins in a single breach without falling once.
goblin-breach-daily-hunt.title=The day's cull
goblin-breach-daily-hunt.description=The breaches refill as fast as they are emptied. Today's cull: fifty goblins, whichever breach you open.
goblin-breach.in-breach=In the Guttering Hollows

